    <string name="license_rust_crates_title">Rust libraries</string>
    <string name="license_rust_crates_text">The RAW engine is written in Rust and bundles the following crates, all licensed under MIT and/or Apache-2.0 unless noted:
• image (image-rs contributors) — decoding/resizing
• zune-jpeg (Caleb Etemesi) — JPEG decoding
• jpeg-encoder (Volker Ströbel) — JPEG encoding; MIT/Apache-2.0 and IJG (contains code based on the Independent JPEG Group\'s libjpeg)
• jxl-oxide — JPEG XL decoding
• serde, serde_json, toml — data handling
• rayon — parallelism
• chrono — date handling
• log, android_logger — logging
• byteorder, bitstream-io, zerocopy, memmap2, libflate, weezl, md5, uuid, thiserror and other small utility crates

Full license texts are available at https://crates.io for each crate.</string>

